{"title":"🐾 Lend a Hand, Save Some Paws!","startsAt":"2026-10-03T14:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-03T16:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Join us this Saturday for a small community volunteer effort to help spread the word about the M1L Trap-Neuter-Return (TNR) initiative.\n\nWe’ll meet near Santa Monica Blvd & St. Clair Ave E and distribute flyers in the surrounding neighbourhood. I’ll have the flyers with me and assign everyone an area to cover when we meet, so you don’t need to figure out the route beforehand.\n\n📬 The job is simple: walk around your assigned area and place the flyers in mailboxes. You can cover as much as you’re comfortable with.\n\n❤️ A couple of hours of our time can help reach many residents and support healthier lives for the neighbourhood’s stray and feral cats.\n\nCome join us, get some fresh air, meet a few fellow animal lovers, and do a little good! 🐾\n\nNo experience needed — just bring comfortable shoes and a willingness to help!","venue":{"name":"Santa Monica Blvd","address":"69 Clapperton Ave Scarborough, ON M1L 4K7, Toronto","lat":43.712505,"lng":-79.27674,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Vibe & Wander","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/2/8/3/highres_536393891.jpeg"}